# Dependencies for the AI test engineering toolkit's own validation command
# (python -m ai_testing.validate_catalog). Deliberately separate from
# requirements.in: every CI job installs the test-runtime lock
# (requirements.txt), so anything added there is installed by the lint job and
# the nightly cross-browser sweep alike. Nothing in the browser test runtime
# imports these, and no test requires them to run - the catalog self-tests skip
# when they are absent.
#
# Regenerate the pinned lock with the same tool the test-runtime lock uses:
#   pip-compile --no-index --output-file=requirements-ai.txt --strip-extras requirements-ai.in
